  "description": "When the Giant stops playing, the toys in Villa Cascabel are trapped in a world where time feels frozen, and toys aren’t allowed to move or even dream about the outside. Lucas, a toy cowboy, lives under the rule of the tyrannical Sheriff Clockwork Claw.\n\nWhen word of a Big Cleanse threatens to make some toys disappear, Lucas and his crew go looking for a legendary treasure hidden by Bili the Boots, said to give toys real freedom.\n\nWith a mob of unlikely allies, they set off on an adventure through familiar places that have turned into dangerous territory. Their mission is to find three keys and the Eternal Golden Dock, hoping to change the fate of every toy that was once loved.\n\nAn interactive storybook experience. A perfect linear narrative adventure for young readers to enjoy a captivating story at their own pace.",
